  <!-- 3. Bidirectional Promoter Engineering -->
  <div id="sec-opt-promoter">
    <h3 data-text-en="Bidirectional promoter engineering" data-text-zh="双向启动子改造">Bidirectional promoter engineering</h3>
    <p data-text-en="The wild-type Psal-Pr bidirectional promoter contains atypical -10 and -35 sequences, leading to low RNA polymerase binding affinity and poor transcriptional activity in E. coli. We performed site-directed mutagenesis on core promoter regions: the -10 box was optimized to TATAAT and the -35 box to TTGACA, fully matching the conserved consensus sequence of E. coli."
       data-text-zh="野生型Psal‑Pr双向启动子的‑10、‑35区序列不典型，导致RNA聚合酶结合亲和力低，在大肠杆菌中转录活性差。我们对核心启动子区域进行了定点突变：将‑10 box优化为TATAAT、‑35 box优化为TTGACA，使其完全匹配大肠杆菌的保守共有序列。">
      The wild-type Psal-Pr bidirectional promoter contains atypical ‑10 and ‑35 sequences, leading to low RNA polymerase binding affinity and poor transcriptional activity in <em>E. coli</em>. We performed site-directed mutagenesis on core promoter regions: the ‑10 box was optimized to TATAAT and the ‑35 box to TTGACA, fully matching the conserved consensus sequence of <em>E. coli</em>.
    </p>
    <p data-text-en="The optimized promoter significantly enhanced transcriptional output. The salicylic acid detection limit decreased from 0.1 mM to 20 μM, achieving a 5-fold improvement in sensitivity, which laid a solid foundation for trace signal capture and low-concentration pollutant detection."
       data-text-zh="优化后的启动子显著提升了转录输出。水杨酸检测下限从0.1 mM降至20 μM，灵敏度提升5倍，为痕量信号捕获与低浓度污染物检测奠定了基础。">
      The optimized promoter significantly enhanced transcriptional output. The salicylic acid detection limit decreased from 0.1 mM to 20 μM, achieving a <strong>5-fold improvement in sensitivity</strong>, which laid a solid foundation for trace signal capture and low-concentration pollutant detection.
    </p>
    <div class="key-finding">
      <p data-text-en="Result: Salicylic-acid detection limit 0.1 mM → 20 μM (5× more sensitive) after -10/-35 box optimization to TATAAT / TTGACA."
         data-text-zh="结果：‑10/‑35 box优化为TATAAT / TTGACA后，水杨酸检测下限由0.1 mM降至20 μM，灵敏度提升5倍。">
        <strong>Result:</strong> Salicylic‑acid detection limit 0.1 mM → 20 μM (5× more sensitive) after ‑10/‑35 box optimization to TATAAT / TTGACA.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 4. NahR Saturation Mutagenesis -->
  <div id="sec-opt-nahr">
    <h3 data-text-en="NahR saturation mutagenesis" data-text-zh="NahR饱和突变">NahR saturation mutagenesis</h3>
    <p data-text-en="NahR is the core sensory protein that determines the system's salicylic acid recognition sensitivity. Based on the optimized Psal promoter backbone, we constructed a saturation mutagenesis library targeting key functional sites N169 and R248 of NahR. After plate preliminary screening and liquid rescreening, we obtained the high-performance mutant NahR-118 (G169T248)."
       data-text-zh="NahR是决定系统水杨酸识别灵敏度的核心传感蛋白。在优化后的Psal启动子骨架基础上，我们针对NahR的关键功能位点N169与R248构建了饱和突变文库，经平板初筛与液体复筛，获得了高性能突变体NahR‑118（G169T248）。">
      NahR is the core sensory protein that determines the system's salicylic acid recognition sensitivity. Based on the optimized Psal promoter backbone, we constructed a saturation mutagenesis library targeting key functional sites N169 and R248 of NahR. After plate preliminary screening and liquid rescreening, we obtained the high-performance mutant <strong>NahR‑118 (G169T248)</strong>.
    </p>
    <p data-text-en="This mutant exhibits obvious fluorescence induction under extremely low salicylic acid concentration (1 μM), greatly improving the system's ultra-low concentration detection capability. In addition, the mutant plasmid presents a relaxed topological conformation, which optimizes NahR-ligand and NahR-DNA interaction, amplifies transcriptional output, reduces background noise and improves signal-to-noise ratio."
       data-text-zh="该突变体在极低水杨酸浓度（1 μM）下即表现出明显的荧光诱导，大幅提升了系统对超低浓度目标物的检测能力。此外，突变体质粒呈现松弛的拓扑构象，优化了NahR‑配体与NahR‑DNA的相互作用，放大了转录输出，降低了背景噪声，提高了信噪比。">
      This mutant exhibits obvious fluorescence induction under extremely low salicylic acid concentration (1 μM), greatly improving the system's ultra-low concentration detection capability. In addition, the mutant plasmid presents a relaxed topological conformation, which optimizes NahR‑ligand and NahR‑DNA interaction, amplifies transcriptional output, reduces background noise and improves signal‑to‑noise ratio.
    </p>
    <div class="key-finding">
      <p data-text-en="Result: NahR-118 (G169T248) responds clearly to 1 μM salicylic acid, with reduced background and improved signal-to-noise ratio."
         data-text-zh="结果：NahR‑118（G169T248）对1 μM水杨酸即有明显响应，背景噪声降低，信噪比提升。">
        <strong>Result:</strong> NahR‑118 (G169T248) responds clearly to 1 μM salicylic acid, with reduced background and improved signal‑to‑noise ratio.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 5. Degradation Pathway Promoter Optimization -->
  <div id="sec-opt-degradation">
    <h3 data-text-en="Degradation promoter optimization" data-text-zh="降解启动子优化">Degradation promoter optimization</h3>
    <p data-text-en="The wild-type naphthalene degradation gene cluster is weakly expressed in E. coli, resulting in low naphthalene-to-salicylate conversion efficiency and insufficient sensory signal. To strengthen upstream degradation performance, we tested five constitutive promoters with different expression strengths and selected P114 as the optimal replacement for the native promoter."
       data-text-zh="野生型萘降解基因簇在大肠杆菌中表达水平较低，导致萘向水杨酸的转化效率不足、上游感应信号不充分。为增强上游降解性能，我们测试了5种不同表达强度的组成型启动子，最终选定P114作为原生启动子的最优替换方案。">
      The wild-type naphthalene degradation gene cluster is weakly expressed in <em>E. coli</em>, resulting in low naphthalene-to-salicylate conversion efficiency and insufficient sensory signal. To strengthen upstream degradation performance, we tested five constitutive promoters with different expression strengths and selected <strong>P114</strong> as the optimal replacement for the native promoter.
    </p>
    <p data-text-en="After promoter replacement, bacterial naphthalene metabolism was significantly enhanced. The coupled degradation-sensing system achieved a 1.4-fold higher fluorescence output compared with the original system, effectively smoothing the whole signal pathway from naphthalene degradation to fluorescence generation."
       data-text-zh="更换启动子后，菌株的萘代谢能力显著增强。耦合降解‑感应系统的荧光输出较原系统提升了1.4倍，有效打通了从萘降解到荧光产生的整条信号通路。">
      After promoter replacement, bacterial naphthalene metabolism was significantly enhanced. The coupled degradation-sensing system achieved a <strong>1.4‑fold higher fluorescence output</strong> compared with the original system, effectively smoothing the whole signal pathway from naphthalene degradation to fluorescence generation.
    </p>
    <div class="key-finding">
      <p data-text-en="Result: Native degradation promoter replaced with P114, giving 1.4× higher coupled fluorescence output."
         data-text-zh="结果：原生降解启动子替换为P114后，耦合系统荧光输出提升1.4倍。">
        <strong>Result:</strong> Native degradation promoter replaced with P114, giving 1.4× higher coupled fluorescence output.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 6. Culture Condition Optimization -->
  <div id="sec-opt-culture">
    <h3 data-text-en="Culture condition optimization" data-text-zh="培养条件优化">Culture condition optimization</h3>
    <p data-text-en="Naphthalene dioxygenase (NahA), the key degrading enzyme, relies on [2Fe-2S] metal cofactors for catalytic activity. To further enhance degradation efficiency, we systematically optimized medium composition, metal ion supplementation and incubation time. The results proved that supplementation of 0.5 mg/mL Fe²⁺ in LBA100 medium maximizes enzyme activity."
       data-text-zh="关键降解酶萘双加氧酶（NahA）的催化活性依赖[2Fe‑2S]金属辅因子。为进一步提升降解效率，我们对培养基组成、金属离子添加量与孵育时间进行了系统优化。结果表明，在LBA100培养基中补充0.5 mg/mL Fe²⁺可使酶活性达到最大。">
      Naphthalene dioxygenase (NahA), the key degrading enzyme, relies on [2Fe‑2S] metal cofactors for catalytic activity. To further enhance degradation efficiency, we systematically optimized medium composition, metal ion supplementation and incubation time. The results proved that supplementation of <strong>0.5 mg/mL Fe²⁺</strong> in LBA100 medium maximizes enzyme activity.
    </p>
    <p data-text-en="Under optimal conditions, the system completes naphthalene degradation and produces stable fluorescence signals within only 3 hours, realizing rapid detection and greatly shortening the experimental cycle."
       data-text-zh="在最优条件下，系统可在3小时内完成萘降解并产生稳定的荧光信号，实现了快速检测，大幅缩短了实验周期。">
      Under optimal conditions, the system completes naphthalene degradation and produces stable fluorescence signals within only <strong>3 hours</strong>, realizing rapid detection and greatly shortening the experimental cycle.
    </p>
    <div class="key-finding">
      <p data-text-en="Result: 0.5 mg/mL Fe²⁺ in LBA100 medium maximizes NahA activity; stable fluorescence achieved within 3 hours."
         data-text-zh="结果：LBA100培养基中添加0.5 mg/mL Fe²⁺可使NahA活性最大化；3小时内即可获得稳定荧光信号。">
        <strong>Result:</strong> 0.5 mg/mL Fe²⁺ in LBA100 medium maximizes NahA activity; stable fluorescence achieved within 3 hours.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 7. Dual-strain Co-culture System Optimization -->
  <div id="sec-opt-coculture">
    <h3 data-text-en="Dual-strain co-culture optimization" data-text-zh="双菌共培养优化">Dual-strain co-culture optimization</h3>
    <p data-text-en="Bacterial ratio and cell density are critical to the stability and sensitivity of the co-culture system. We optimized the inoculation ratio and working OD gradiently, and finally determined the optimal working density of sensor strain as OD₆₀₀ = 0.8. The standardized dual-strain system exhibits high stability and repeatability, achieving an ultra-low detection limit of 0.1 μM for naphthalene, which fully meets the detection demand of trace environmental pollutants."
       data-text-zh="菌株接种比例与细胞密度是共培养系统稳定性与灵敏度的关键因素。我们对接种比例与工作OD进行了梯度优化，最终确定传感菌株的最优工作密度为OD₆₀₀ = 0.8。标准化后的双菌系统表现出高稳定性与可重复性，对萘的检测下限达到0.1 μM，充分满足环境痕量污染物的检测需求。">
      Bacterial ratio and cell density are critical to the stability and sensitivity of the co-culture system. We optimized the inoculation ratio and working OD gradiently, and finally determined the optimal working density of sensor strain as <strong>OD₆₀₀ = 0.8</strong>. The standardized dual-strain system exhibits high stability and repeatability, achieving an ultra-low detection limit of <strong>0.1 μM</strong> for naphthalene, which fully meets the detection demand of trace environmental pollutants.
    </p>
    <div class="key-finding">
      <p data-text-en="Result: Optimal sensor-strain working density OD₆₀₀ = 0.8; standardized dual-strain system reaches a 0.1 μM naphthalene detection limit."
         data-text-zh="结果：传感菌株最优工作密度OD₆₀₀ = 0.8；标准化双菌系统对萘的检测下限达到0.1 μM。">
        <strong>Result:</strong> Optimal sensor-strain working density OD₆₀₀ = 0.8; standardized dual-strain system reaches a 0.1 μM naphthalene detection limit.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

