<!-- ==================== 8. Design Summary & Future Prospect ==================== -->
<section id="sec-summary" class="wetlab-animate">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div class="section-icon">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb"></i>
    </div>
    <div class="section-heading-text">
      <h2 data-text-en="Design Summary &amp; Future Prospect" data-text-zh="设计总结与未来展望">Design Summary &amp; Future Prospect</h2>
      <div class="section-heading-bar"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p data-text-en="To solve the low sensitivity, weak signal and low degradation efficiency of the wild-type system, we performed five-layer iterative optimization: bidirectional promoter modification enhanced transcription, NahR saturation mutagenesis improved ultra-trace recognition, degradation promoter replacement strengthened metabolism, metal ion optimization accelerated catalysis, and dual-strain standardization stabilized signal output."
     data-text-zh="为解决野生型系统灵敏度低、信号弱、降解效率不足的问题，我们进行了五层迭代优化：双向启动子改造增强了转录，NahR饱和突变提升了超痕量识别能力，降解启动子替换强化了代谢，金属离子优化加速了催化，双菌标准化稳定了信号输出。">
    To solve the low sensitivity, weak signal and low degradation efficiency of the wild-type system, we performed five-layer iterative optimization: bidirectional promoter modification enhanced transcription, NahR saturation mutagenesis improved ultra-trace recognition, degradation promoter replacement strengthened metabolism, metal ion optimization accelerated catalysis, and dual-strain standardization stabilized signal output.
  </p>

  <p data-text-en="Finally, we constructed a high-sensitivity, fast-response and high-stability dual-strain PAHs biosensing platform. Free from reliance on large precision instruments, our system enables low-cost and rapid screening of naphthalene pollution in soil and water, providing a novel and convenient synthetic biology solution for urban invisible organic pollution monitoring."
     data-text-zh="最终，我们构建了一套高灵敏度、快响应、高稳定性的双菌PAHs生物传感平台。该系统无需依赖大型精密仪器，即可实现对土壤与水体中萘污染的低成本快速筛查，为城市隐性有机污染监测提供了一种新颖、便捷的合成生物学解决方案。">
    Finally, we constructed a <strong>high-sensitivity, fast-response and high-stability</strong> dual-strain PAHs biosensing platform. Free from reliance on large precision instruments, our system enables low-cost and rapid screening of naphthalene pollution in soil and water, providing a novel and convenient synthetic biology solution for urban invisible organic pollution monitoring.
  </p>

  <p data-text-en="For practical application, we plan to develop portable PAHs detection kits based on our optimized biosensing system, suitable for on-site field detection, community soil surveys and suburban farmland sampling. Furthermore, we have built a supporting online photographic identification platform. By capturing fluorescence images under ultraviolet excitation and utilizing the fitting conversion relationship between green saturation and normalized fluorescence intensity, the platform can intelligently and quantitatively calculate naphthalene concentration, realizing a fully lightweight detection process of 'sampling-culturing-photographing-intelligent quantification' and further lowering the threshold of environmental pollutant detection."
     data-text-zh="面向实际应用，我们计划基于优化后的传感系统开发便携式PAHs检测试剂盒，适用于现场检测、社区土壤排查与城郊农田采样。此外，我们还搭建了配套的在线拍照识别平台：通过采集紫外激发下的荧光图像，并利用绿色饱和度与归一化荧光强度之间的拟合换算关系，平台可以智能定量计算萘浓度，实现『采样‑培养‑拍照‑智能定量』的全流程轻量化检测，进一步降低环境污染物检测的门槛。">
    For practical application, we plan to develop portable PAHs detection kits based on our optimized biosensing system, suitable for on-site field detection, community soil surveys and suburban farmland sampling. Furthermore, we have built a supporting online photographic identification platform. By capturing fluorescence images under ultraviolet excitation and utilizing the fitting conversion relationship between green saturation and normalized fluorescence intensity, the platform can intelligently and quantitatively calculate naphthalene concentration, realizing a fully lightweight detection process of "sampling‑culturing‑photographing‑intelligent quantification" and further lowering the threshold of environmental pollutant detection.
  </p>
</section>

